{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/94a0f9ea6e969f90334586f1c0de0a76.avif?t=1758365582\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before the town\u2026 Before the cult\u2026 There was the silence of the apartment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a decaying building with no way out, Alex must uncover what lies behind the sealed doors, flickering lights, and symbols etched into the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tales of Ancients: Hollow Apartment \u2013 Prologue</i> is a standalone introduction to the atmospheric horror story of Alex \u2014 a documentary photographer who is just beginning to understand how deep the mystery goes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alex was ready to leave. His bag was packed.<br>But when he opened the door\u2026<br>\u2026everything was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hallway was there \u2014 and yet not. Shadows where people once lived. Sounds where silence should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no exit. No contact. No help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only floors to descend\u2026 and something waiting at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/7764e7091144b78f24857639407874f4.avif?t=1758365582\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened here?<br>Why is he the only one left?<br>And why does the basement call to him?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Exploration and Puzzle Solving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search abandoned apartments, decode mysterious notes, and solve ancient symbol puzzles to progress deeper into the building\u2019s secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f Atmospheric Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense silence, distant echoes, and subtle shifts in reality. The deeper you go, the more uncertain your surroundings become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Narrative-Driven Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a demo. It is the first step in a larger journey \u2014 introducing you to the world, history, and horrors that await in the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/31a77c8581c0c4809815c841bd36e3f2.avif?t=1758365582\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone Prologue Chapter</strong> (3\u20134 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person psychological horror</strong> in a single, haunting location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbol-based puzzles</strong> and hidden story fragments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons. No fighting. Just your eyes, ears, and instincts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ties directly into the upcoming full release of Tales of Ancients</strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do You Dare Begin the Descent?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every locked door has a story.<br>Every floor takes you further from the truth.<br>And the basement... was never meant to be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/bad4e55bc662148b3bb7bb4fffa42505.avif?t=1758365582\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/d11e6a511bdabef38b62911d868c5c11.avif?t=1758365582\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836090?t=1758365582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758365582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/cdc270ae3be57e283c8b2ac9f3298766672998a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758365582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/cdc270ae3be57e283c8b2ac9f3298766672998a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758365582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/94a0f9ea6e969f90334586f1c0de0a76.avif?t=1758365582\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before the town\u2026 Before the cult\u2026 There was the silence of the apartment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a decaying building with no way out, Alex must uncover what lies behind the sealed doors, flickering lights, and symbols etched into the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tales of Ancients: Hollow Apartment \u2013 Prologue</i> is a standalone introduction to the atmospheric horror story of Alex \u2014 a documentary photographer who is just beginning to understand how deep the mystery goes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>